OL,5,G1930 Radio 3 in Concert
OL,6,     FIn his first concert as the
OL,7,     Fgroup's new Chief Conductor, Owain
OL,8,     FPark conducts the BBC Singers in
OL,9,     Fthe UK premiere of Joby Talbot's
OL,10,     FPiedra de sol and motets by Tomas
OL,11,     FLuis de Victoria.
OL,12,G2145 The Essay: This Sounding Isle
OL,13,     FKate Kennedy is in Aldeburgh,
OL,14,     Ffollowing in the footsteps of
OL,15,     FBenjamin Britten, in her next stop
OL,16,     Faround the UK to seek connections
OL,17,     Fbetween a place and the music it's
OL,18,     Finspired.
